Id: inet001w
Severity: WARN
Category: network
Check: check_inetd
Controls: CIS 4.8, 3.10; NIST CM-7, SC-8; ISO 8.21, 5.14; CE Secure configuration

inetd serves an old cleartext or trust-based service: telnet,
rsh, rlogin, rexec, finger, tftp or uucp. They hand the machine
to anyone listening. Turn the service off, or inetd with it.
